Z||000026||FieroKyle||11-07-2001||11:45 PM||||The Grand National is basically an option for the Regal. They had the same motor and did the same things performance and luxury wise.<P>I totally agree and forgot about the early 90's Toronados. I love those cars. Definetly very nice, not the fastest, but very nice. Can't get enough of the 2 door cruisers. A new set of rims, and a sound system, and those things are the ultimate weekend cruiser.||||reg||1
